# =============================================================================
# thesis-cpp .gitignore
# Policy: commit ONLY the author's own source code and documentation.
# Everything is ignored by default; code/doc file types are re-included;
# then heavy/external/personal directories are re-ignored so they never leak.
# =============================================================================

# --- 1. Ignore everything by default -----------------------------------------
*

# --- 2. But allow git to descend into directories ----------------------------
!*/

# --- 3. Whitelist source code -------------------------------------------------
!*.py
!*.pyi
!*.ipynb
!*.sh
!*.bash
!*.bat
!*.ps1
!*.php
!*.js
!*.ts
!*.jsx
!*.tsx
!*.html
!*.css
!*.c
!*.cc
!*.cpp
!*.h
!*.hpp
!*.java

# --- 4. Whitelist config (part of the code) ----------------------------------
!*.yaml
!*.yml
!*.toml
!*.cfg
!*.ini
!*.conf
!*.gitignore
!.gitignore
!Dockerfile
!Makefile
!requirements*.txt
!*.gitattributes

# --- 5. Whitelist documentation ----------------------------------------------
!*.md
!*.rst
!*.txt
!LICENSE
!LICENCE
!README*

# --- 6. Re-ignore heavy / external / generated directories (these win) --------
# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
.venv-glyph/
**/site-packages/
**/pyvenv.cfg
# Python caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
# Node
node_modules/
# Vendored / third-party source (not the author's own work)
third_party/
vendor/
# Model weights / checkpoints / caches
checkpoints/
hf_cache/
.cache/
wandb/
runs/

# --- 7. Never commit secrets or personal data --------------------------------
personal/
.env
.env.*
*.env
secrets*
*.key
*.pem
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- 8. Datasets & binaries (belt-and-suspenders; not whitelisted anyway) -----
*.zip
*.tar
*.gz
*.7z
*.rar
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bmp
*.tiff
*.webp
*.svg
*.ico
*.pdf
*.csv
*.parquet
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.bin
*.h5
*.npy
*.npz
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.ttf
*.otf
*.woff
*.woff2

# --- 9. Specific run-output artifacts (not code or docs) ----------------------
mvp_results/
cryptbb_sourcefree/data/render_gallery.html
